  "description": "Upgrade your Car interior with OEDRO custom-fit floor mats, engineered for precision and lasting protection. Using advanced 3D laser scanning, these mats deliver a perfect, glove-like fit that keeps pedals clear and driving safer. Crafted from premium TPE, they stay flexible in extreme temperatures, resist wear, and remain completely odor-free—ideal for families and pets. Their sleek, Compass-inspired design complements your cabin while keeping mud, snow, and spills locked in for effortless cleaning.\nFeatures\nTailored Precision Fit: 3D laser-measured to match every contour of the 2022-2026 Jeep Grand Cherokee 5 Seats (Include 4xe Not for WK or L), preventing pedal interference for worry-free driving.\nPremium All-Weather TPE: Eco-friendly, recyclable material stays durable, non-toxic, and odorless while withstanding heat, cold, and heavy use.\nStylish Interior Upgrade: Modern pattern blends seamlessly with the Compass interior, adding a refined look without sacrificing protection.\nTotal Spill Containment: Raised edges and full-coverage design trap mud, snow, sand, and liquid; just lift out, shake, and rinse for a like-new finish.\nTrusted OEDRO Quality: Backed by over a decade of floor-liner expertise and U.S.-based support, delivering reliable performance for more than 300 vehicle models.\n2-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2022-2026 Jeep Grand Cherokee 5 Seats\nInclude 4xe Not for WK or L Models\nNot Fit to Jeep Grand Cherokee L 7 Seats.",
  "highlights": [
    "All-weather protection system with deep channels and raised edges that trap mud, snow, and spills, keeping your floor clean, dry, and fully protected year-round.",
